<meta name="description" content="Together we are all Jayhawks! At Jamestown Community College, we welcome student athletes locally and from all over the world. Join Jayhawks Athletics and you&#039;ll meet teammates and coaches who will support you as you succeed both in the classroom and with your team. JCC is a member of the Western New York Athletic Conference (WNYAC) and Region III of the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA)." />
