    <article data-history-node-id="10082" role="article" about="/experience/athletics" class="node">

      
            

      <div>
        
            <div class="body field__item"><h2>Together we are all Jayhawks!</h2>

<p>At Jamestown Community College, we welcome student athletes locally and from all over the world. Join Jayhawks Athletics and you'll meet teammates and coaches who will support you as you succeed both in the classroom and with your team.</p>

<p>JCC is a member of the Western New York Athletic Conference (WNYAC) and Region III of the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA).</p>

<h3>The Physical Education Complex spaces include:</h3>

<ul><li>Upstairs: 1/10 mile track, batting cages, Sport Management classroom, and weights area</li>
	<li>First floor: athletic training room, gym floor, pool and aquatic center, and wrestling practice room</li>
	<li>Outside: Diethrick Park stadium and soccer field</li>
	<li><a href="/experience/athletics/tour">Take a full virtual tour of PHED »</a></li>
</ul><p><iframe allow="autoplay; fullscreen; web-share; xr-spatial-tracking;" allowfullscreen="" alt="Physical Education Complex | PHED Virtual Tour with ability to click or tap through the space, which is also described in following text and gallery" frameborder="0" height="480" src="https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=cWDfi4ZF39y" title="Physical Education Complex | PHED Virtual Tour" width="100%"></iframe></p>
</div>
      
      </div>

      

    </article>
  </div>

